WEBVTT

00:00:35.301 --> 00:00:40.364
Colonel Strings to HQ.
Colonel Strings to HQ.

00:00:40.407 --> 00:00:44.707
Time is 05:21. Initiating
target penetration. Over.

00:00:51.951 --> 00:00:52.918
Let's go!

00:00:59.426 --> 00:01:01.587
Dreams come true!

00:01:01.628 --> 00:01:05.291
From red deserts
to blue oceans!

00:01:05.331 --> 00:01:09.392
Astro Technologies is making
your dreams come true!

00:01:10.470 --> 00:01:14.702
We're advocating a project
to safely create oceans...

00:01:14.741 --> 00:01:18.438
...by using ice chunks
floating in orbit of Mars.

00:01:18.478 --> 00:01:21.345
All we ask for
is your support...

00:01:21.381 --> 00:01:24.839
...and then we really can
make dreams come true!

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:43.496
Antimatter reactor
has overloaded.

00:01:43.536 --> 00:01:46.164
Levels have reached
critical zone!

00:01:46.206 --> 00:01:50.233
Danger! All personnel,
evacuate at once!

00:01:54.447 --> 00:01:58.178
For the sake of humanity, for the
sake of our righteous goal...

00:02:01.554 --> 00:02:02.578
DI E!!!

00:02:48.234 --> 00:02:50.259
The Third Project?

00:02:51.237 --> 00:02:54.400
The reception of a distress
call from an antimatter plant...

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:56.408
...on an isolated island
in the Pacific...

00:02:56.442 --> 00:02:59.741
...has resulted in the dispatch
of an army special forces unit.

00:02:59.779 --> 00:03:03.579
According to our investigation,
robots at the plant have rebelled...

00:03:03.616 --> 00:03:06.312
...resulting in the deaths of
many of the plant's staff.

00:03:06.352 --> 00:03:08.411
While the situation
is now under control...

00:03:08.454 --> 00:03:11.423
...we are currently waiting for a
comment from the robots' maker...

00:03:21.067 --> 00:03:22.659
Yoko!

00:03:22.702 --> 00:03:23.828
Bye-bye!

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:26.304
Good-bye, dear.

00:03:31.144 --> 00:03:33.305
Were you waiting long?

00:03:33.813 --> 00:03:35.440
Mr. Oldman!

00:03:35.481 --> 00:03:39.417
Be sure her mother comes by to
help out at the bazaar tomorrow!

00:03:39.819 --> 00:03:41.548
Uh... Right!

00:03:42.155 --> 00:03:44.123
You think mommy will come?

00:03:44.357 --> 00:03:47.417
I dunno. She's not too
good with stuff like that.

00:03:59.372 --> 00:04:01.272
Mommy, we're home!

00:04:01.307 --> 00:04:03.537
Where are you, "Mommy?"

00:04:03.576 --> 00:04:06.443
...and the anti-robot movement
has now spread all over the world.

00:04:06.479 --> 00:04:10.540
As a reaction, President Hemming
of the Earth Robotronics Union...

00:04:10.583 --> 00:04:12.448
...the leader in
the robot industry...

00:04:12.485 --> 00:04:15.511
...has just made a statement.
Let's see that recording.

00:04:16.489 --> 00:04:19.225
The problem occurs in Seconds,
manufactured only on Mars...

00:04:19.225 --> 00:04:22.319
...which have a
fractal circuit installed.

00:04:22.362 --> 00:04:24.853
These things aren't necessary
for robots anyway.

00:04:24.897 --> 00:04:29.095
I hope the more frequent usage of
Earth-made Seconds equipped with...

00:04:29.135 --> 00:04:30.903
Welcome home.
...human obedience circuits is
reconsidered in light of this incident.

00:04:30.903 --> 00:04:32.029
...human obedience circuits is
reconsidered in light of this incident.

00:04:32.071 --> 00:04:33.506
That was President Hemming
of the ERU. In other news...

00:04:33.506 --> 00:04:34.941
Mommy!
That was President Hemming
of the ERU. In other news...

00:04:34.941 --> 00:04:36.932
Check it out.
That was President Hemming
of the ERU. In other news...

00:04:47.754 --> 00:04:50.188
- Happy birthday, Yoko.
- Congratulations, Yoko.

00:04:57.163 --> 00:04:59.825
A token of my
affection, Naomi.

00:05:04.804 --> 00:05:07.932
Is today your birthday, too,
Mommy? Same as mine?

00:05:15.081 --> 00:05:19.415
Yoko, those roses are my thanks for
this feast your mother made for us.

00:05:20.086 --> 00:05:21.553
Oh, I get it.

00:05:21.587 --> 00:05:24.886
Okay, then I'll give you
a thank-you present, too.

00:05:29.462 --> 00:05:31.430
My birthday, huh?

00:07:04.824 --> 00:07:08.385
The Chicago police today announced the
submission of a bill to the Assembly...

00:07:08.428 --> 00:07:11.522
...to reduce the number of robot police
officers who have been deployed...

00:07:11.564 --> 00:07:12.963
...to work on simple
duties such as...

00:07:12.999 --> 00:07:15.501
...dealing with parking violations
and cleaning up after accidents.

00:07:15.501 --> 00:07:18.197
It's expected to pass
sometime this week.

00:07:22.575 --> 00:07:27.069
All right, after this commercial,
we'll be back with a live interview...

00:07:27.113 --> 00:07:31.072
...here at Blue 5 Net studios with
Colonel Strings, the commander of...

00:07:31.117 --> 00:07:33.915
...the 404th mobile troops which
raided that antimatter plant.

00:07:45.965 --> 00:07:49.128
And now a Blue 5 Net
exclusive interview!

00:07:49.535 --> 00:07:52.800
You were the first man on-site
during the raid, is that correct?

00:07:52.839 --> 00:07:56.240
Yes, ma'am. The first one in
and the last one out.

00:07:58.177 --> 00:08:01.806
Were the robots so dangerous
that you needed to use guns?

00:08:02.849 --> 00:08:07.445
The only survivors were 8 of my men
and just 3 of the plant's personnel.

00:08:07.487 --> 00:08:09.955
We tried our best.

00:08:10.823 --> 00:08:14.884
Are you on the side of the humans?
Or are you on the side of the robots?

00:08:14.927 --> 00:08:17.191
My own beliefs
guide my actions.

00:08:17.230 --> 00:08:20.393
Humans are humans
and robots are robots.

00:08:21.467 --> 00:08:24.163
Human rights are reserved
for humans only, I'd say.

00:08:24.670 --> 00:08:28.470
Thank you for your time.
That was Colonel Strings.

00:09:24.931 --> 00:09:27.957
This vehicle is in
violation of traffic laws.

00:09:28.234 --> 00:09:29.326
Further pursuit is...

00:10:35.635 --> 00:10:38.126
Who are you, lady?

00:10:38.170 --> 00:10:41.003
I have some business with the
colonel. He's in there, isn't he?

00:10:43.609 --> 00:10:47.340
Right now, I'd say the colonel
is enjoying a nice drink!

00:10:52.118 --> 00:10:53.107
What the?!

00:10:56.222 --> 00:10:57.211
BOO!

00:11:19.578 --> 00:11:24.606
A Second, enhanced for hand-
to-hand combat. Handmade...

00:11:25.251 --> 00:11:28.482
You're not human, are you?

00:11:28.521 --> 00:11:32.287
Who are you supposed to be?
The Tin Woodsman in a full-body cast?

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:36.119
I may get a bonus if I just...

00:11:36.162 --> 00:11:39.598
...take your head back
with me, my little Dorothy.

00:11:51.177 --> 00:11:53.509
Ow... Damn, that thing's strong!

00:12:03.122 --> 00:12:06.785
I just need to have your head left,
or else I won't get any bonus.

00:12:45.564 --> 00:12:47.361
I may have overdone it...

00:12:47.399 --> 00:12:49.833
"Rank: Sergeant."

00:12:49.869 --> 00:12:52.565
"404th mobile troops,
reserve forces."

00:12:53.506 --> 00:12:55.906
I knew it.
One of Strings's men.

00:13:21.567 --> 00:13:23.262
They sure have
this planned out...

00:13:28.607 --> 00:13:32.907
Yoko... This may take
longer than I expected.

00:13:49.328 --> 00:13:51.262
So, you're still alive...

00:13:52.798 --> 00:13:55.232
The lost Third...

00:13:56.435 --> 00:13:59.996
The Angel of
Death and Life, eh?

00:14:20.926 --> 00:14:23.224
Hm? Oh, hi, Kevin.

00:14:23.262 --> 00:14:26.231
You're relieved. Anything
left for me to worry about?

00:14:26.265 --> 00:14:28.665
- Not a damned thing.
- What's that?

00:14:30.202 --> 00:14:34.935
Someone mailed in a threat.
Earth-lovers, most likely.

00:14:34.974 --> 00:14:37.204
They apparently
don't like the fact...

00:14:37.243 --> 00:14:40.246
...that we make high-compression
propellant here.

00:14:40.246 --> 00:14:43.010
They say Martians should
live in the deserts...

00:14:43.048 --> 00:14:44.982
...and stop wishing for oceans.

00:14:45.017 --> 00:14:46.951
Well, have a nice shift.

00:14:59.531 --> 00:15:02.364
All set... Good luck!

00:15:32.965 --> 00:15:33.989
Shit!

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:55.211
You aren't going to break through
the security here! Give up!

00:15:55.254 --> 00:15:58.417
Oh, we'll head straight home
after we blow up this facility...

00:15:58.457 --> 00:16:00.015
...and all the rocket fuel here!

00:16:06.732 --> 00:16:08.859
C'mon! C'mon!
Is that all you've got?!

00:16:20.746 --> 00:16:22.111
Shit!

00:16:24.116 --> 00:16:26.050
GOOD NIGHT, BABY!

00:16:48.040 --> 00:16:50.031
How are you? Hurt bad?

00:16:50.576 --> 00:16:52.567
Nah, it's nothing serious.

00:16:52.611 --> 00:16:56.377
Good to hear. Man, you did
a great job in there.

00:16:56.415 --> 00:16:58.542
Outstanding, really.

00:16:59.685 --> 00:17:02.449
Unfortunately, there are
some complications...

00:17:03.022 --> 00:17:03.989
Huh?

00:17:05.624 --> 00:17:08.650
The police have just
issued a statement.

00:17:09.428 --> 00:17:12.761
They stopped the vehicle
with the escaping terrorists...

00:17:12.798 --> 00:17:15.596
...and arrested the last three.

00:17:15.901 --> 00:17:19.803
It's just... The three of
them are all robots.

00:17:19.838 --> 00:17:23.274
Robots?! But, what about
the ones I killed?

00:17:23.308 --> 00:17:25.037
They were human.

00:17:25.077 --> 00:17:26.840
Humans?!

00:17:27.279 --> 00:17:29.747
But there was no way I
could tell in that situation!

00:17:29.782 --> 00:17:31.613
I know, I know.

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:34.210
We'll have lawyers at
the press conference.

00:17:34.253 --> 00:17:36.778
The only words you'll say
there are "No comment."

00:17:36.822 --> 00:17:39.382
Got that? Everything'll
be fine, so don't worry.

00:17:40.259 --> 00:17:42.750
And dress those bandages
up to make it look worse.

00:17:42.795 --> 00:17:45.389
You're a hero who risked
his life in the line of duty.

00:17:45.431 --> 00:17:49.231
A victim. Got that?!
Okay, come on!

00:18:01.013 --> 00:18:02.947
Hi, Julian.

00:18:05.150 --> 00:18:06.708
Hi, Armitage.

00:18:06.785 --> 00:18:10.186
It's been a long time since
anyone's called me by that name.

00:18:10.222 --> 00:18:11.450
You saw it, right?

00:18:11.490 --> 00:18:14.459
Yeah. You mean about
the First Error, right?

00:18:14.626 --> 00:18:16.992
- Tell me about it.
- It doesn't interest me.

00:18:17.029 --> 00:18:19.589
- Why not?
- Because I'm a ghost.

00:18:19.631 --> 00:18:21.792
I couldn't care less about
things in the mortal world.

00:18:21.834 --> 00:18:23.495
Julian!

00:18:27.106 --> 00:18:28.698
Thanks, Julian.

00:18:30.876 --> 00:18:32.605
Judging from the situation...

00:18:32.644 --> 00:18:37.047
...Mr. Kevin Oldman merely
carried out his duty, that's all.

00:18:37.382 --> 00:18:39.748
But the three human
terrorists are dead...

00:18:39.785 --> 00:18:43.277
...while their three robot
accomplices are completely unharmed.

00:18:43.322 --> 00:18:46.018
Is there a special reason
for that, Mr. Oldman?

00:18:46.091 --> 00:18:49.254
I believe we explained
that already!

00:18:49.294 --> 00:18:50.761
When you have
terrorists who are...

00:18:50.796 --> 00:18:53.196
...ready to use a liquid
explosive bomb breaking in...

00:18:53.232 --> 00:18:55.427
...do you think
there's time to sort out...

00:18:55.467 --> 00:18:57.196
...which are human and
which are robots?!

00:18:57.236 --> 00:19:01.468
The question was for Kevin.
Please answer it, sir.

00:19:02.174 --> 00:19:05.803
He's been through enough today!
Would you cut it out already?

00:19:06.178 --> 00:19:07.611
Hold it! Just a moment!

00:19:09.681 --> 00:19:12.172
Are you one of those
robot fetishists?

00:19:12.217 --> 00:19:14.208
Do you subscribe to
"Deep Robo" magazine?

00:19:14.253 --> 00:19:16.121
Do you use a robot maid?

00:19:16.121 --> 00:19:18.112
Ever had sex with a robot?

00:19:18.157 --> 00:19:19.886
Would you all stop it?!

00:19:19.925 --> 00:19:22.257
Robots only do what
they're ordered to do!

00:19:22.528 --> 00:19:24.155
The real criminals
are the humans!

00:19:29.001 --> 00:19:31.970
...and Mr. Oldman has gained
an amazing amount of support...

00:19:32.004 --> 00:19:34.939
...as the vanguard of those
who believe in Robot Rights...

00:19:34.973 --> 00:19:38.670
...and desire a new social order
which denies human supremacy.

00:19:38.710 --> 00:19:42.146
Furthermore, the incident is
expected to have a large effect...

00:19:42.181 --> 00:19:45.951
...on the upcoming Chicago Summit
between Earth and Mars in 2 weeks...

00:19:45.951 --> 00:19:48.146
...which will address
the Robot Rights bill.

00:19:48.187 --> 00:19:50.417
We have an analyst
here with an opinion.

00:19:50.455 --> 00:19:54.050
Should robots be granted
the same rights as humans?

00:19:54.092 --> 00:19:56.151
Most of Earth had been
against it and would say no...

00:19:56.195 --> 00:19:58.390
...but the more liberal
Martians had favored it.

00:19:58.430 --> 00:20:01.729
Because of that, the bill was
expected to go nowhere...

00:20:01.767 --> 00:20:03.928
...but the aftermath
of the First Error...

00:20:03.969 --> 00:20:06.597
...slightly moved Martian
public opinion against it.

00:20:06.638 --> 00:20:12.042
However, this latest incident has
revitalized Robot Rights activities.

00:20:13.178 --> 00:20:15.146
Well, our focus
now will be on...

00:20:15.180 --> 00:20:17.842
...how this all affects
the upcoming summit.

00:20:22.854 --> 00:20:27.587
You really did it this time, Kevin.
Or should I say Ross Sylibus?

00:20:33.799 --> 00:20:38.532
I'm sorry, all of the robot
doormen were let go.

00:20:38.604 --> 00:20:40.333
Let me get that
bag for you.

00:21:07.566 --> 00:21:09.500
Who are you?

00:21:10.469 --> 00:21:12.300
You're Strings, right?

00:21:12.337 --> 00:21:15.101
I came to ask why
you killed those robots.

00:21:15.140 --> 00:21:16.505
What?

00:21:16.541 --> 00:21:19.444
I'm talking about all
those robots you killed.

00:21:19.444 --> 00:21:23.437
Killed? Robots?
Don't you mean "destroyed?"

00:21:23.482 --> 00:21:25.109
Does that include
the humans, too?

00:21:25.150 --> 00:21:28.711
You probably know that 18% of
that plant's staff was human.

00:21:30.255 --> 00:21:32.621
You act as though you
were there yourself.

00:21:34.526 --> 00:21:38.121
For the sake of humanity, for the
sake of our righteous goal...

00:21:39.765 --> 00:21:42.598
You! You're a robot?!

00:21:49.107 --> 00:21:50.870
You're garbage!

00:21:50.909 --> 00:21:52.968
Some sick monster
who gets off on killing!

00:21:53.145 --> 00:21:56.911
You killed them all to hide the existence
of the Third Project, didn't you?!

00:21:57.416 --> 00:21:59.714
Third? What are
you talking about?

00:21:59.751 --> 00:22:01.286
Don't play dumb!

00:22:01.286 --> 00:22:02.753
Hold it!

00:22:03.822 --> 00:22:06.791
Hold it right there,
Naomi Armitage.

00:22:07.392 --> 00:22:08.882
Demitrio...

00:22:09.161 --> 00:22:11.755
I can just see
tomorrow's headlines:

00:22:11.797 --> 00:22:16.291
"Hero of the First Error suppression,
murdered by robot assassin."

00:22:16.768 --> 00:22:18.235
What?!

00:22:44.162 --> 00:22:46.824
Sorry to have exposed you
to such unpleasantness.

00:22:46.865 --> 00:22:49.129
How do you
know my name?

00:22:49.935 --> 00:22:51.926
Well, well, well!

00:22:51.970 --> 00:22:55.633
Has life on the run dulled
your detective's intuition?

00:22:56.108 --> 00:22:59.077
My name is Demitrio Mardini.

00:22:59.111 --> 00:23:02.171
Executive Vice President
of Earth Robotronics.

00:23:02.981 --> 00:23:07.077
And you're the daughter of the great
genius, Dr. Asakura, are you not?

00:23:09.755 --> 00:23:14.021
I've so looked forward to
meeting you. This is an honor.

00:23:14.059 --> 00:23:15.993
Welcome to Earth, my dear!

00:23:16.027 --> 00:23:18.757
Now, shall we get
down to business?

00:23:29.708 --> 00:23:31.437
I've brought him, sir.

00:23:34.679 --> 00:23:37.978
It's been a long time,
Ross Sylibus.

00:23:39.384 --> 00:23:40.874
Mr. Chairman...

00:23:40.919 --> 00:23:46.653
I called you here for a reason.
I need a favor, Ross.

00:23:46.825 --> 00:23:48.315
Y- Yes, sir...

00:23:48.593 --> 00:23:51.027
Would you go
to Earth, please?

00:23:51.062 --> 00:23:54.122
I want you to attend
the Chicago Summit.

00:23:56.301 --> 00:24:00.931
As the representative
of me, Frederick Ohara...

00:24:00.972 --> 00:24:04.305
...chairman of the Martian
Development Foundation.

00:24:05.177 --> 00:24:07.372
You'll go, won't you?

00:24:08.280 --> 00:24:10.475
Me, sir?

00:24:13.518 --> 00:24:16.316
To begin with,
the remarkable advancements...

00:24:16.354 --> 00:24:20.791
...in robot production techniques on
Mars have been driven by necessity.

00:24:20.826 --> 00:24:23.056
The birth rate has been
dropping dramatically...

00:24:23.094 --> 00:24:25.028
...since the fourth
generation of colonists.

00:24:25.063 --> 00:24:26.932
And there's a labor shortage.

00:24:26.932 --> 00:24:32.063
That, in turn, led to a need for
robots to be dependable partners.

00:24:33.572 --> 00:24:36.803
If they're to be partners,
they need to be given rights...

00:24:36.842 --> 00:24:39.868
...protected by law as good
citizens and good neighbors.

00:24:39.911 --> 00:24:43.369
It's the only logical
outcome, isn't it?

00:24:44.583 --> 00:24:47.108
But it's an outcome
I can't allow.

00:24:49.321 --> 00:24:52.222
Demand for the Seconds
imported from Mars...

00:24:52.257 --> 00:24:54.191
...is slowing my company down.

00:24:54.226 --> 00:24:57.491
And if the Robot Rights bill goes
through, things will get worse.

00:24:57.529 --> 00:25:01.397
It could shake every union
to its foundations.

00:25:01.633 --> 00:25:05.535
As a businessman,
I want to prevent that.

00:25:05.570 --> 00:25:08.198
So, you're spinning
a new scenario.

00:25:08.240 --> 00:25:11.175
You made up the First Error,
the robot uprising.

00:25:11.877 --> 00:25:16.075
Not quite. The uprising
did actually happen.

00:25:19.084 --> 00:25:22.952
If you made it all the
way to Earth like this...

00:25:22.988 --> 00:25:24.956
...you must know
about that already.

00:25:24.990 --> 00:25:27.754
I don't just know
about it! I saw it!

00:25:27.792 --> 00:25:31.728
I'm carrying the memories of a
Third who was built in that plant!

00:25:32.664 --> 00:25:37.192
I see. It's fascinating how
you robots communicate...

00:25:37.636 --> 00:25:41.936
Listen to me. You Thirds live
a very sad existence.

00:25:42.407 --> 00:25:46.366
No one will acknowledge you exist,
and so you're doomed to be forgotten.

00:25:46.411 --> 00:25:50.142
What I want is to give you all a
clear and specific purpose in life:

00:25:50.582 --> 00:25:53.346
The creation of human beings!

00:25:53.385 --> 00:25:55.216
A most honorable
purpose, is it not?

00:25:55.921 --> 00:25:58.856
Oh, that's bullshit! Why do
you think the Thirds rebelled...

00:25:58.890 --> 00:26:01.017
...when they were forced
into that research?!

00:26:01.159 --> 00:26:03.684
Well, I can't believe it.

00:26:04.029 --> 00:26:08.830
Your friends tried to escape
from the Garden of Eden.

00:26:10.001 --> 00:26:13.437
Listen, this is a wonderful
operation I'm proposing.

00:26:14.339 --> 00:26:17.172
From time immemorial, the most
difficult task has been...

00:26:17.208 --> 00:26:19.642
...the creation of humans
you can manipulate freely.

00:26:20.745 --> 00:26:23.043
Now you can do it.

00:26:23.081 --> 00:26:25.572
You can make a cheap labor
force who will never complain.

00:26:25.617 --> 00:26:27.551
Or produce soldiers
who aren't afraid of dying.

00:26:27.586 --> 00:26:29.713
Creating people to simply love
would be nice, too, wouldn't it?

00:26:29.754 --> 00:26:32.416
The ultimate product,
wouldn't you say?

00:26:33.258 --> 00:26:36.557
You...
You want to play God?

00:26:38.797 --> 00:26:40.389
Not quite...

00:26:40.599 --> 00:26:44.057
Perhaps just have the
power of one of His chosen.

00:26:44.102 --> 00:26:47.503
And that's why you killed the
human staff members as well.

00:26:47.539 --> 00:26:49.507
Yes, that's right.

00:26:52.110 --> 00:26:55.780
So, won't you come with me?
To my Garden of Eden?

00:26:55.780 --> 00:26:59.648
If you have that other Third's
memories, you must understand.

00:26:59.684 --> 00:27:02.585
I need your power.
I need you...

00:27:02.621 --> 00:27:05.613
The original Third.

00:27:06.291 --> 00:27:07.892
Go to hell.

00:27:07.892 --> 00:27:09.757
You disappoint me.

00:27:16.334 --> 00:27:17.130
Grab her!

00:27:19.871 --> 00:27:21.998
You seem to be in pain
all of a sudden.

00:27:34.285 --> 00:27:37.186
So, how do you like
its jamming functions?

00:27:48.066 --> 00:27:49.590
All right! Take her!

00:27:54.472 --> 00:27:56.235
What's wrong?!

00:28:01.346 --> 00:28:04.144
This date's over.
You're just not my type!

00:28:29.074 --> 00:28:32.577
Did she get away?
Or is she dead?

00:28:32.577 --> 00:28:34.977
No...
She's a Third, after all...

00:29:40.979 --> 00:29:43.743
Oh, I found a
real beauty here!

00:29:43.782 --> 00:29:47.115
This isn't some consumer model you
can get off the assembly lines!

00:29:47.152 --> 00:29:50.178
Skeletal frame says
"Made on Mars."

00:29:51.523 --> 00:29:54.754
Well, let's ask this little
stranger who she is...

00:29:58.029 --> 00:30:00.725
These are her
latest memories.

00:30:03.134 --> 00:30:06.035
I doubt it misfired...

00:30:08.072 --> 00:30:09.835
Oh, I see...

00:30:10.609 --> 00:30:13.601
She took over its power systems
and then must have activated...

00:30:13.646 --> 00:30:16.581
...the gun's safety and its
proximity fuse at the same time.

00:30:16.615 --> 00:30:19.743
Well, that's how you use
telepresence abilities!

00:30:20.119 --> 00:30:21.848
Hey!

00:30:21.887 --> 00:30:24.185
Quit poking around
in my memories!

00:30:25.157 --> 00:30:27.148
Didn't mean any harm!

00:30:27.192 --> 00:30:31.130
I'm Mouse, a repairman.
And you, my dear, are a mess.

00:30:31.130 --> 00:30:34.725
Your main autonomous nerve lines and
vital parts are completely severed.

00:30:34.767 --> 00:30:36.667
If you went to a dealer...

00:30:36.702 --> 00:30:40.570
...they'd tell you to forget about
repairs and just buy a new body!

00:30:41.240 --> 00:30:44.698
Unfortunately, I'm kinda
attached to this body.

00:30:44.743 --> 00:30:47.337
Anyway, I need to move again.
Can you do that?

00:30:47.379 --> 00:30:51.406
CAN I? I am a genius!

00:30:51.650 --> 00:30:54.084
However, it'll cost you.

00:30:54.119 --> 00:30:57.054
Payment to be made in
Earth dollars. And no IOUs!

00:31:24.683 --> 00:31:27.709
We will soon be arriving
at the orbital station.

00:31:27.753 --> 00:31:31.390
The following connecting shuttles
are scheduled to leave from there:

00:31:31.390 --> 00:31:34.621
Chicago, flight 102,
departing at 13:00.

00:31:34.660 --> 00:31:35.718
Brasilia, flight 347...

00:31:35.761 --> 00:31:39.527
Daddy, it's just like
you said! It's so pretty!

00:31:39.565 --> 00:31:42.261
Toronto, flight 618,
departing at 14:10.

00:31:42.301 --> 00:31:43.928
Yeah...

00:31:44.670 --> 00:31:47.332
Would you go
to Earth, please?

00:31:48.574 --> 00:31:50.098
We've worked so hard on...

00:31:50.142 --> 00:31:53.134
...the Robot Rights summit
and have gotten so far.

00:31:53.178 --> 00:31:56.341
I naturally intended
to attend it myself...

00:31:56.382 --> 00:32:00.580
...but in light of what happened
to you, I've changed my mind.

00:32:03.122 --> 00:32:05.852
Earth is very nervous about...

00:32:05.891 --> 00:32:08.883
...the rising drive for
Martian independence.

00:32:08.927 --> 00:32:11.020
They're threatened
by the pressure for...

00:32:11.063 --> 00:32:12.997
...the Zephyria terra
forming project.

00:32:13.032 --> 00:32:15.000
And now they're
telling us to accept...

00:32:15.034 --> 00:32:17.798
...40 million immigrants during
the fourth stage of development.

00:32:17.836 --> 00:32:19.497
Their attitude is drastic.

00:32:20.272 --> 00:32:26.040
The point is, Earth wants to
keep Mars as its colony.

00:32:29.415 --> 00:32:33.613
Despite what it says,
we all need robots now.

00:32:33.652 --> 00:32:38.680
Not just for Martian development,
but for humanity's future.

00:32:38.724 --> 00:32:41.659
And the Rights bill is
necessary for that future.

00:32:41.694 --> 00:32:45.721
I agree with you.
But, why me, sir?

00:32:45.764 --> 00:32:48.597
Because you're the
man for the time.

00:32:49.068 --> 00:32:51.366
The hero of Mars.

00:32:51.904 --> 00:32:57.865
Oh, you may not have intended
to become that, but you are now.

00:32:58.544 --> 00:33:02.081
I would like to use your
standing to full advantage...

00:33:02.081 --> 00:33:04.811
...in getting the Robot
Rights bill passed.

00:33:06.085 --> 00:33:11.090
Ross... You can't keep
hiding forever.

00:33:11.090 --> 00:33:15.789
This is also a good chance to
ensure Yoko's future, isn't it?

00:33:18.397 --> 00:33:23.664
Let's say, if you scratch
my back, I'll scratch yours...

00:33:24.903 --> 00:33:26.768
Thank you for choosing
All Martian Spacelines today.

00:33:26.805 --> 00:33:29.273
What have you
got there, Yoko?

00:33:29.308 --> 00:33:31.208
It's a secret!

00:33:33.345 --> 00:33:35.905
I hope we see
Mommy soon...

00:33:36.782 --> 00:33:40.684
And with 2 days to go until the
Chicago Summit on Robot Rights opens...

00:33:40.719 --> 00:33:44.086
...AII Martian Spacelines
flight 102 landed...

00:33:44.123 --> 00:33:47.183
...with the Martian
representatives today.

00:33:47.760 --> 00:33:52.094
Among them is this man,
currently the talk of the town.

00:33:52.131 --> 00:33:54.224
Mr. Kevin Oldman.

00:33:54.266 --> 00:33:56.168
So, he's still alive...
As a result of his comments...

00:33:56.168 --> 00:33:59.037
...made after the terrorist attack on
Astro Technologies only days ago...

00:33:59.037 --> 00:34:01.206
I see now...
...he's received overwhelming
support from Robot Rights activists.

00:34:01.206 --> 00:34:03.333
So, that's what's going on.
...he's received overwhelming
support from Robot Rights activists.

00:34:27.533 --> 00:34:28.500
Nice job!

00:34:42.848 --> 00:34:45.373
Okay, I have a few
little things to do now.

00:34:45.417 --> 00:34:47.476
Once I'm done,
we'll go look for Mommy.

00:35:13.078 --> 00:35:16.445
Before the opening of today's
summit on Robot Rights...

00:35:16.481 --> 00:35:19.314
...all of the major
robotronics companies'...

00:35:19.351 --> 00:35:21.911
...sagging stock prices
are now taking off.

00:35:22.454 --> 00:35:26.686
This is due to their announcement
that all robots will now be made...

00:35:26.725 --> 00:35:30.729
...with a slave circuit installed
which will guarantee loyalty...

00:35:30.729 --> 00:35:33.391
...and ensure that robots
will never harm humans.

00:35:33.699 --> 00:35:36.133
Stockholders are also reacting
positively to the possibility...

00:35:36.168 --> 00:35:38.728
...that the industry's healthy
economy might be restored...

00:35:38.770 --> 00:35:41.000
...should the Robot Rights bill
fail to win passage.

00:36:13.272 --> 00:36:16.764
Welcome, Mr. Oldman.

00:36:16.808 --> 00:36:20.437
What's going on here?!
Where's my daughter?!

00:36:20.479 --> 00:36:24.245
Please, calm down.
As you can see, she's unharmed.

00:36:25.350 --> 00:36:26.339
Yoko!

00:36:28.987 --> 00:36:31.089
Why are you doing this?!

00:36:31.089 --> 00:36:34.024
I want you to vote against
the Robot Rights bill.

00:36:34.059 --> 00:36:35.390
What?!

00:36:35.427 --> 00:36:37.691
The reason being...
Well...

00:36:37.729 --> 00:36:40.197
If I call you this,
will you understand then...

00:36:42.401 --> 00:36:44.266
...Ross Sylibus?

00:36:44.303 --> 00:36:45.827
How did you?!

00:36:49.908 --> 00:36:52.775
You seem to
catch on fast.

00:36:52.811 --> 00:36:54.472
If you vote against the bill...

00:36:54.513 --> 00:36:57.539
...your pretty little daughter
will be returned unharmed.

00:36:57.582 --> 00:37:01.245
If you don't do
as I ask, well...

00:37:01.486 --> 00:37:04.216
It's all up to you, isn't it?

00:37:04.823 --> 00:37:06.381
It's now time for the vote...

00:37:06.425 --> 00:37:09.485
...at the much-anticipated
Chicago Summit on Robot Rights.

00:37:09.528 --> 00:37:12.258
Let's now go live
via relay to the summit.

00:37:16.835 --> 00:37:17.995
Ross?

00:37:18.637 --> 00:37:20.439
We will begin
taking the vote.

00:37:20.439 --> 00:37:22.941
All those in favor of
the new bill from Mars...

00:37:22.941 --> 00:37:25.739
...the Robot Rights bill,
please stand up.

00:37:27.913 --> 00:37:29.813
What's going on?

00:37:31.249 --> 00:37:34.480
As expected, all the Martian
delegates are for the bill...

00:37:34.519 --> 00:37:37.613
...while all of the Earth
delegates oppose it.

00:37:37.656 --> 00:37:39.851
Once again the Martian
bill will not easily pass...

00:37:41.860 --> 00:37:43.020
What's this?!

00:37:43.061 --> 00:37:46.189
Mr. Oldman, one of the Martian
delegates, isn't standing in support!

00:37:46.231 --> 00:37:49.530
If he doesn't stand,
the bill will be thrown out!

00:37:50.168 --> 00:37:51.931
He's up! No, wait!

00:37:51.970 --> 00:37:52.868
Ross!

00:37:53.705 --> 00:37:55.866
He's approaching the chairman.

00:37:58.543 --> 00:38:03.037
Three votes for passage,
four against, one abstention.

00:38:03.081 --> 00:38:05.345
The motion is denied!

00:38:06.385 --> 00:38:08.876
Mr. Oldman has
abstained from the vote!

00:38:08.920 --> 00:38:10.979
This is a completely
unexpected turn!

00:38:11.023 --> 00:38:12.957
The bill has not passed!

00:38:17.896 --> 00:38:22.162
He abstained...
Well, I'll let it go.

00:39:00.205 --> 00:39:02.537
What am I missing?

00:39:04.009 --> 00:39:07.137
Or are you telling me
the ability to conceive life...

00:39:07.179 --> 00:39:09.272
...is only in the
province of God?

00:39:14.352 --> 00:39:17.651
Hi there, Demitrio!
You want my data?

00:39:18.223 --> 00:39:21.215
Hi there, Demitrio!
You want my data?

00:39:21.259 --> 00:39:23.090
Who's?

00:39:24.229 --> 00:39:25.856
Yes.

00:39:26.364 --> 00:39:28.798
Then I'll transfer over
some sample data for you.

00:39:28.834 --> 00:39:32.827
If you want the merchandise,
contact Mouse Robot Service.

00:39:33.038 --> 00:39:34.835
Your password is...

00:39:36.108 --> 00:39:38.599
An informant, eh?
Interesting...

00:39:56.795 --> 00:39:58.228
All set.

00:40:00.132 --> 00:40:04.296
Please feel free to deal with
Mouse Robot Service any time.

00:40:04.336 --> 00:40:06.770
You now have the
last of the data...

00:40:06.805 --> 00:40:08.705
Hold it.

00:40:08.740 --> 00:40:10.799
Let me confirm this.

00:40:19.718 --> 00:40:22.118
So, this is the last
of the data, you say?

00:40:22.921 --> 00:40:26.118
BULLSHIT!
This isn't all of it!

00:40:26.158 --> 00:40:30.891
It is, I swear! What you
wanted is on that disc, too!

00:40:33.598 --> 00:40:37.090
What I want is the data
on her ability to conceive!

00:40:39.070 --> 00:40:40.438
Wh- What?!

00:40:40.438 --> 00:40:42.269
Tell me!
Where are you hiding it?!

00:40:42.307 --> 00:40:43.968
I don't know about
any such data!

00:40:44.009 --> 00:40:47.570
If it's in there,
it's somewhere out of my reach!

00:40:47.612 --> 00:40:49.705
Anyway, I gave you
everything I have!

00:40:49.748 --> 00:40:53.582
If you can't analyze it,
your system must be obsolete!

00:40:53.618 --> 00:40:55.449
Don't play dumb!
I can't complete...

00:40:55.487 --> 00:40:57.887
...the conception functions
with just this data!

00:40:59.624 --> 00:41:01.683
That's impossible!

00:41:01.726 --> 00:41:04.991
You should be able to clone her
exactly by copying the hardware...

00:41:05.530 --> 00:41:07.725
Something must
be wrong, then!

00:41:09.701 --> 00:41:11.100
You!

00:41:14.806 --> 00:41:18.867
You don't have the vital piece?!
Some informant!

00:41:43.468 --> 00:41:45.561
What the?!

00:41:52.911 --> 00:41:54.572
Armitage?

00:42:02.220 --> 00:42:05.883
Just like her, aren't they?
99% like her, at least.

00:42:05.924 --> 00:42:08.916
But I'm still missing
that last, vital part.

00:42:09.494 --> 00:42:12.486
Now then, give me
the remaining data.

00:42:12.597 --> 00:42:15.623
I told you, I don't have it!

00:42:15.667 --> 00:42:18.761
Don't you want to see robots
who can give birth to children?

00:42:18.803 --> 00:42:20.498
Oh, get real!

00:42:24.776 --> 00:42:27.006
He must have a
connector somewhere.

00:42:27.612 --> 00:42:30.479
Rip the data out
of his memory bank.

00:42:51.569 --> 00:42:52.968
Well?

00:42:54.572 --> 00:42:56.437
Shit...

00:42:58.610 --> 00:43:02.102
All that leaves us
with is the daughter.

00:43:03.481 --> 00:43:06.041
Dump this trash
in the bin, would you?

00:43:21.666 --> 00:43:25.864
That son of a bitch!
I won't forget this!

00:43:26.171 --> 00:43:29.800
I swear... He'll regret
messing with me!

00:43:34.846 --> 00:43:37.246
Hotel Royal Greenhill.

00:43:37.282 --> 00:43:39.842
The Martian Development
Foundation representatives, please.

00:43:39.884 --> 00:43:42.045
Well, they've
gone already...

00:43:42.087 --> 00:43:44.214
Mr. Kevin Oldman, as well?

00:43:44.255 --> 00:43:49.420
No, he isn't back yet, so he's still
registered as staying in this hotel.

00:43:50.362 --> 00:43:52.626
Can I help you
with anything else?

00:43:54.466 --> 00:43:57.765
No, never mind.
Thank you.

00:44:01.773 --> 00:44:03.741
What's happened, Ross?

00:44:45.049 --> 00:44:46.949
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:44:48.119 --> 00:44:52.579
Where's my daughter?!
You promised me you'd return her!

00:44:53.091 --> 00:44:57.221
Relax. As promised,
you'll be with your daughter again...

00:44:59.597 --> 00:45:00.825
In Heaven.

00:45:02.000 --> 00:45:03.934
You were planning this
from the start, weren't you?!

00:45:07.839 --> 00:45:09.238
What the hell?

00:45:09.407 --> 00:45:10.806
Get out!

00:45:11.075 --> 00:45:13.168
Who the hell are you?!

00:45:13.211 --> 00:45:14.940
Police officer!

00:45:15.547 --> 00:45:17.276
Well, formerly...

00:45:34.699 --> 00:45:36.394
Why, you!

00:45:50.281 --> 00:45:51.543
What?!

00:45:53.318 --> 00:45:54.546
These guys are nuts!

00:47:51.903 --> 00:47:54.337
The day Yoko was born...

00:47:54.372 --> 00:47:58.741
I was so happy. The happiest
I've ever been in my life.

00:48:00.011 --> 00:48:02.605
But I was worried, too.

00:48:04.816 --> 00:48:08.718
I was worried that, one day,
I might lose both you and Yoko.

00:48:14.959 --> 00:48:16.620
I'm sorry.

00:48:16.661 --> 00:48:18.856
I'm sorry I left
without telling you.

00:48:20.131 --> 00:48:23.396
But I just had to
know the truth.

00:48:23.434 --> 00:48:25.698
Because I'm a Third, too.

00:48:28.406 --> 00:48:31.967
And now my precious little
Yoko is mixed up in all this.

00:48:33.077 --> 00:48:35.375
Some mother I am!

00:48:48.993 --> 00:48:50.824
Naomi...

00:48:50.862 --> 00:48:53.695
Stop trying to take on
every problem by yourself.

00:48:59.370 --> 00:49:03.841
We can change our names
and forge new identities...

00:49:03.841 --> 00:49:06.674
...but if we can't
escape our destiny...

00:49:06.711 --> 00:49:08.645
...then we'll fight it.

00:49:09.547 --> 00:49:13.278
For Yoko...
And for us as a family.

00:49:16.421 --> 00:49:18.013
Ross!

00:49:18.056 --> 00:49:20.547
Yoko's waiting.
Let's go get her.

00:49:28.533 --> 00:49:31.161
Thank you, Ross...

00:50:05.236 --> 00:50:07.466
Your I D cannot be confirmed.

00:50:07.505 --> 00:50:11.309
If you do not leave within 10 seconds,
you will be removed by force!

00:50:11.309 --> 00:50:12.469
Ten!

00:50:12.510 --> 00:50:13.611
Nine!

00:50:13.611 --> 00:50:14.635
Eight!

00:50:14.679 --> 00:50:15.737
Seven!

00:50:15.780 --> 00:50:16.747
Six!

00:50:16.781 --> 00:50:20.114
I'm here for my daughter.
Now move!

00:50:20.151 --> 00:50:21.243
Two!

00:50:21.285 --> 00:50:22.217
One!

00:50:53.684 --> 00:50:57.245
If you've harmed
my daughter, I'll kill you!

00:51:00.792 --> 00:51:03.454
I'll keep that in mind.

00:51:31.823 --> 00:51:36.123
Give me the company info of
this building! Search: Demitrio!

00:51:40.464 --> 00:51:41.761
There!

00:51:43.467 --> 00:51:45.492
Ross! Do you hear me?!

00:51:45.536 --> 00:51:46.604
Yeah!

00:51:46.604 --> 00:51:49.300
Room 49, level 258!

00:51:49.340 --> 00:51:52.366
It's some sort of lab,
but I think she's in there!

00:51:53.277 --> 00:51:55.813
Naomi, I just contacted Mars!

00:51:55.813 --> 00:51:59.544
I've had a shuttle readied for us
on an unused orbital elevator!

00:51:59.884 --> 00:52:02.284
It takes off at 5:00 AM!
That gives us four hours!

00:52:04.522 --> 00:52:07.124
Naomi, don't do
anything reckless.

00:52:07.124 --> 00:52:09.627
They're after my secret.

00:52:09.627 --> 00:52:12.289
I'm not gonna let them get
their hands on me so easily.

00:52:14.699 --> 00:52:16.291
Anyway,
don't underestimate them.

00:52:18.035 --> 00:52:19.502
I hear you.

00:52:39.390 --> 00:52:41.483
What, him again?!

00:52:52.169 --> 00:52:54.069
You wanna end up
like you did before?

00:52:54.105 --> 00:52:56.471
You're a slow learner,
aren't you?

00:53:00.311 --> 00:53:03.144
I'd prefer it if you wouldn't wreck
any more of my merchandise.

00:53:04.148 --> 00:53:05.911
Demitrio!

00:53:05.950 --> 00:53:07.815
Shall we discuss this?

00:53:07.852 --> 00:53:10.821
All I'll discuss is you
giving me my daughter back!

00:53:11.622 --> 00:53:14.113
Sure you want to brush
me off so quickly?

00:53:20.064 --> 00:53:21.088
Yoko!

00:53:26.637 --> 00:53:29.663
You can't release her.
I have the access protected.

00:53:36.347 --> 00:53:37.507
Is this it?

00:53:42.586 --> 00:53:43.678
Shit!

00:53:44.755 --> 00:53:47.451
The door's locked!
Can you release it?

00:53:48.092 --> 00:53:51.892
Impossible. It's protected, so my
telepresence won't work!

00:53:52.029 --> 00:53:55.430
Ross, there's something else!
Listen to me! That room's a freezer!

00:53:56.033 --> 00:53:57.864
What?!

00:53:57.902 --> 00:53:59.233
Yoko's in danger!

00:53:59.270 --> 00:54:02.398
I'll buy some time.
Ross, you'll have to handle it.

00:54:15.653 --> 00:54:17.553
There, that's better.

00:54:28.199 --> 00:54:29.257
Shit!

00:54:57.995 --> 00:55:01.192
I ran some tests on
your daughter's body.

00:55:01.232 --> 00:55:04.099
I found no unusual
abilities in her.

00:55:05.036 --> 00:55:08.733
How disappointing.
Just a normal child...

00:55:09.440 --> 00:55:12.500
What did you do to Yoko?!
Did you hurt her?!

00:55:13.711 --> 00:55:18.614
Hurt her? My dear,
I'm not a barbarian!

00:55:18.649 --> 00:55:23.211
I just took some small
blood and tissue samples.

00:55:23.521 --> 00:55:27.548
You can relax. I have
no use for a normal child.

00:55:41.772 --> 00:55:42.966
Daddy...

00:55:44.075 --> 00:55:46.441
I'm a lenient man.

00:55:47.011 --> 00:55:51.175
I'm willing to forget the
considerable damage and rudeness...

00:55:51.215 --> 00:55:54.651
...you and your husband have
inflicted on my company.

00:55:55.052 --> 00:55:57.955
However, that depends
on you telling me...

00:55:57.955 --> 00:56:00.389
...what the secret
of the Thirds is.

00:56:01.859 --> 00:56:02.621
Daddy!

00:56:06.297 --> 00:56:08.959
The secret of your
ability to conceive life.

00:56:13.070 --> 00:56:16.471
My secret?
You really want to know?

00:56:18.943 --> 00:56:21.673
Shall I show it
to you right now?

00:56:22.379 --> 00:56:24.176
You really will?

00:56:27.384 --> 00:56:29.181
Closer, please.

00:56:31.555 --> 00:56:33.284
A little more...

00:56:35.192 --> 00:56:37.956
Yeah... Right there.

00:56:48.572 --> 00:56:50.472
Wait!

00:56:50.508 --> 00:56:53.966
You apparently still don't
understand your position here.

00:56:54.011 --> 00:56:57.314
I can set you
free if you wish.

00:56:57.314 --> 00:56:59.578
Or I can shut your
loud mouth permanently...

00:56:59.617 --> 00:57:02.142
...by having your pretty
little head ripped off!

00:57:02.753 --> 00:57:07.213
But, if you do that,
you'll lose the secret forever.

00:57:07.258 --> 00:57:09.123
You foolish man.

00:57:09.160 --> 00:57:13.654
Don't you know where the power
to create a child is in a woman?

00:57:13.831 --> 00:57:14.855
What?!

00:57:14.999 --> 00:57:19.595
Her heart! You don't just
make a child with your body!

00:57:25.309 --> 00:57:28.335
The love she feels for someone!
The need to protect them!

00:57:28.379 --> 00:57:31.041
The need to pass those
feelings on to the future...

00:57:31.081 --> 00:57:33.174
...is what makes a child!

00:57:39.123 --> 00:57:41.557
You'll never understand that!

00:57:43.727 --> 00:57:47.788
It's the software...
Is that it?

00:57:51.202 --> 00:57:52.567
After her!

00:58:22.433 --> 00:58:24.367
Who are you?!

00:58:43.454 --> 00:58:45.285
Replicas?

00:58:45.322 --> 00:58:48.689
Do you fakes think you
can beat the original?!

00:59:13.817 --> 00:59:15.216
Mommy!

00:59:15.586 --> 00:59:16.746
Yoko!

00:59:18.055 --> 00:59:20.956
Mommy!
Mommy, I missed you!

00:59:20.991 --> 00:59:22.959
Thank God you're okay...

00:59:22.993 --> 00:59:24.790
Mommy, look!

00:59:25.929 --> 00:59:29.421
Here! Your thank-you present
for my birthday party!

00:59:31.669 --> 00:59:34.900
It's a bead ring!
I worked really hard on it!

00:59:35.806 --> 00:59:38.400
I wanted to give it to
you as soon as I could.

00:59:38.809 --> 00:59:40.902
I see. I'm sorry, hon.

00:59:50.954 --> 00:59:52.512
What's wrong?

00:59:56.593 --> 00:59:58.561
Th-This is just!

01:00:03.000 --> 01:00:04.297
Yoko!

01:00:21.952 --> 01:00:23.112
Naomi...

01:00:29.526 --> 01:00:31.050
What are they?

01:00:34.531 --> 01:00:36.226
Naomi, hurry!

01:00:38.102 --> 01:00:39.729
- Go without me.
- What?!

01:00:39.770 --> 01:00:42.762
- I'll hold them off here!
- NAOMI!

01:01:50.025 --> 01:01:53.153
God dammit!
That know-it-all bastard!

01:01:53.195 --> 01:01:56.062
How could he
do that to me?!

01:01:58.334 --> 01:02:00.734
Oh, great. Not again!

01:02:26.428 --> 01:02:28.020
Let's see...

01:02:31.300 --> 01:02:33.359
Well, let's give
it a try and see.

01:03:30.693 --> 01:03:34.185
Looks like this elevator only
runs as high as this floor.

01:03:34.229 --> 01:03:37.198
How do we
ride up from here?!

01:03:37.900 --> 01:03:39.834
Daddy, this way!

01:03:40.903 --> 01:03:43.428
This way! We can
go up through here!

01:03:43.772 --> 01:03:45.501
Yoko!
Don't go running off!

01:03:47.276 --> 01:03:49.176
But we can go up this way!

01:03:49.612 --> 01:03:51.079
How do you know that?

01:03:51.113 --> 01:03:52.580
I saw it downstairs!

01:03:58.320 --> 01:04:00.311
Doesn't look like
it's coming down.

01:04:22.611 --> 01:04:24.203
Someone's behind us.

01:04:26.315 --> 01:04:27.509
What?!

01:04:32.421 --> 01:04:33.183
Daddy!

01:05:19.468 --> 01:05:20.492
NO!!!

01:05:27.876 --> 01:05:30.572
What's wrong?
We're not there yet.

01:05:30.779 --> 01:05:32.508
Yoko's in danger...

01:05:33.348 --> 01:05:36.613
Please, I want you to release
my combat-mode limiter!

01:05:36.652 --> 01:05:38.586
WHAT?!!

01:05:38.620 --> 01:05:41.350
Don't you know what would
happen to your body...

01:05:41.390 --> 01:05:44.985
...if you initiated your combat-
mode without the limiter?!

01:05:45.027 --> 01:05:47.393
Your power level would be
mind-blowing, but still...

01:05:47.429 --> 01:05:50.091
You'll exceed your internal
battery's output limits...

01:05:50.132 --> 01:05:53.192
...and that Class-L heat radiator
system you have inside of you...

01:05:53.235 --> 01:05:54.998
...wouldn't be able
to keep up with it!

01:05:55.037 --> 01:05:57.028
That lovely skin
you're so proud of...

01:05:57.072 --> 01:05:59.040
...would melt down
after only a minutes!

01:05:59.074 --> 01:06:01.736
In the end, your body itself
will lose all control!

01:06:01.777 --> 01:06:05.042
I'm aware of all that!
Please! There's no time!

01:06:07.449 --> 01:06:10.043
Sheesh! Don't blame me
for what happens!

01:06:13.288 --> 01:06:14.516
All clear?

01:06:14.556 --> 01:06:18.127
The password to release your
limiter is "Heaven's Door."

01:06:18.127 --> 01:06:20.254
Knock once, and it opens.

01:06:20.295 --> 01:06:24.026
But if you push things too far,
you'll end up in Heaven for real!

01:06:26.502 --> 01:06:28.197
Anyway, let's go!

01:06:46.555 --> 01:06:48.921
Daddy! Daddy, this way!

01:06:48.957 --> 01:06:50.254
R- Right!

01:07:11.613 --> 01:07:13.979
Yoko, by any chance...

01:07:14.016 --> 01:07:16.385
...did you memorize
the whole floor plan?

01:07:16.385 --> 01:07:17.682
Yeah.

01:07:17.719 --> 01:07:18.879
But how?

01:07:18.921 --> 01:07:22.379
I just looked at it. Daddy,
give me a pen, please.

01:07:32.801 --> 01:07:34.701
I never realized...

01:07:34.736 --> 01:07:36.897
You're a real genius,
aren't you?

01:07:51.954 --> 01:07:53.421
Shit!
It's them again!

01:08:18.347 --> 01:08:19.780
- No!
- Yoko!

01:08:22.251 --> 01:08:23.582
Stay away...

01:08:35.163 --> 01:08:35.686
Mommy...

01:09:00.689 --> 01:09:01.678
Naomi!

01:09:01.723 --> 01:09:03.486
Get on that one!

01:09:07.262 --> 01:09:10.322
- Ross, hurry!
- Right! Yoko!

01:09:35.824 --> 01:09:37.917
Man, this is getting
exciting, isn't it?

01:09:37.960 --> 01:09:40.529
But the real show's
about to start.

01:09:40.529 --> 01:09:43.930
And you, my dear Demitrio,
are the star!

01:09:46.969 --> 01:09:49.267
I have one more
favor to ask.

01:09:49.304 --> 01:09:51.602
What?! Another one?!

01:09:51.640 --> 01:09:54.871
You copied my
memory data, didn't you?

01:09:55.344 --> 01:09:58.313
There's something I'd
like you to do with it.

01:10:04.086 --> 01:10:08.318
She's slick, I'll give her that.
Well, not like I'm one to talk...

01:10:08.357 --> 01:10:12.521
Okay, then! Here we go!
IT'S SHOWTI ME!

01:10:16.832 --> 01:10:19.323
We interrupt this program
for a special report.

01:10:20.502 --> 01:10:24.802
MGN has successfully
secured extraordinary footage...

01:10:24.840 --> 01:10:28.776
...of the robot uprising which has
become known as the First Error.

01:10:29.578 --> 01:10:33.514
As this footage shows,
the energy plant was actually...

01:10:33.548 --> 01:10:36.642
...a front for illegal
Third Project research.

01:10:36.685 --> 01:10:40.018
These shocking scenes
capture the project's failure...

01:10:40.055 --> 01:10:43.286
...and the attempt by the ERU,
fearing its disclosure...

01:10:43.325 --> 01:10:44.726
...to suppress the truth.

01:10:44.726 --> 01:10:47.262
We've also received information
which deeply implicates...

01:10:47.262 --> 01:10:48.163
How dare he!
We've also received information
which deeply implicates...

01:10:48.163 --> 01:10:49.765
How dare he!
...ERU Executive VP
Demitrio Mardini in this affair.

01:10:49.765 --> 01:10:51.392
How dare that little rat!
...ERU executive VP
Demitrio Mardini in this affair.

01:11:10.318 --> 01:11:13.185
What's wrong?
It's two against one!

01:11:14.022 --> 01:11:15.751
Don't hold back
any longer!

01:11:15.924 --> 01:11:18.757
Don't let any of them
off the Earth alive!

01:11:59.034 --> 01:12:00.365
Shit!

01:12:03.672 --> 01:12:05.663
Yoko! Hang on tight!

01:12:41.643 --> 01:12:42.974
Naomi!

01:12:50.218 --> 01:12:52.083
C'mon, get on my back.

01:12:56.558 --> 01:12:58.321
Hang on as tight
as you can!

01:14:11.866 --> 01:14:13.629
Almost there!

01:14:37.425 --> 01:14:39.757
Daddy, we're almost there!

01:14:51.840 --> 01:14:55.674
Welcome to the No. 6
Chicago Orbital Elevator...

01:14:55.710 --> 01:14:57.405
...your gateway to space!

01:15:06.454 --> 01:15:07.352
Naomi!

01:15:50.899 --> 01:15:54.198
There's the shuttle!
C'mon, let's go!

01:15:57.939 --> 01:15:59.133
Yoko.

01:16:02.344 --> 01:16:03.242
Yoko...

01:16:54.763 --> 01:16:56.128
Get back!

01:16:58.566 --> 01:16:59.999
Yoko!

01:17:07.609 --> 01:17:09.133
NAOMI!

01:17:18.820 --> 01:17:19.582
Naomi?

01:17:23.625 --> 01:17:25.024
God dammit!

01:17:35.837 --> 01:17:36.769
Yoko!

01:17:40.742 --> 01:17:42.505
Get your hands...

01:17:42.577 --> 01:17:44.374
Get your hands off Yoko!

01:17:45.847 --> 01:17:46.871
Mommy...

01:17:54.789 --> 01:17:55.687
Mommy!

01:17:56.991 --> 01:17:58.424
- Mommy!
- Look out!

01:18:41.169 --> 01:18:42.830
MOMMY!!!

01:18:45.406 --> 01:18:47.374
Heaven's... DOOR!

01:19:28.349 --> 01:19:32.809
Talk about your simple programs!
"Pursue targets and kill them," huh?

01:19:59.547 --> 01:20:01.208
This is my limit!

01:20:08.489 --> 01:20:09.319
Still?!

01:20:12.193 --> 01:20:17.062
Dammit... There's no way
I'll be beaten by you!

01:20:21.369 --> 01:20:22.927
Mommy!

01:20:24.839 --> 01:20:28.172
Mommy! Stop it, please!

01:20:28.476 --> 01:20:29.374
Yoko...

01:20:29.410 --> 01:20:34.370
You're hurt so bad...
You're going to die!

01:20:57.605 --> 01:21:00.665
GO BACKTO
YOUR MASTER!!!

01:21:18.393 --> 01:21:19.826
Mommy!

01:21:22.797 --> 01:21:27.359
I broke your ring...
Sorry, hon...

01:21:30.071 --> 01:21:34.007
Then... Then I'll make
a ton more for you!

01:21:34.042 --> 01:21:35.339
'Kay?

01:21:42.950 --> 01:21:47.910
Mommy, you're
squishing me! Mommy!

01:21:57.031 --> 01:21:59.727
C'mon, let's go home.

01:22:14.482 --> 01:22:16.575
You think you're
getting away?!

01:22:16.918 --> 01:22:18.977
This vessel is unregistered!

01:22:21.522 --> 01:22:23.990
Verify its license number!

01:22:27.195 --> 01:22:30.164
Vessel confirmed.
Noncompliant license detected.

01:22:30.198 --> 01:22:34.157
Security system, engaged. Do you
wish to clear it for takeoff?

01:22:34.202 --> 01:22:37.296
Like hell!
Transfer weapons control to me!

01:22:38.306 --> 01:22:41.935
That order requires a double-A
or higher security authorization.

01:22:41.976 --> 01:22:45.377
This is Demitrio Mardini!
Password is...

01:22:46.647 --> 01:22:48.171
Verify!

01:22:48.616 --> 01:22:52.746
Confirmed!
Warning! Warning!

01:22:52.787 --> 01:22:55.923
Departing unlicensed vessel
cannot be cleared to leave port!

01:22:55.923 --> 01:22:59.484
If this warning is ignored,
use of force is authorized!

01:23:02.363 --> 01:23:04.422
Now you'll see...

01:23:06.334 --> 01:23:08.029
It's you!

01:23:13.708 --> 01:23:16.404
Wh- Why did you
come back?

01:23:16.577 --> 01:23:18.841
Ready to fire.

01:23:28.055 --> 01:23:29.317
Why?

01:23:32.527 --> 01:23:34.085
I told you before.

01:23:34.128 --> 01:23:36.528
That if you harmed
my daughter, I'd kill you.

01:23:37.031 --> 01:23:40.626
It can't be... Armitage?!

01:24:07.061 --> 01:24:09.791
Please initiate firing mode.

01:24:09.831 --> 01:24:12.095
Please initiate firing mode.

01:24:24.912 --> 01:24:25.936
See you.

01:24:36.224 --> 01:24:39.125
It was announced today that
the government would proceed with...

01:24:39.160 --> 01:24:42.095
...the realization of the
Zephyria terra forming project...

01:24:42.129 --> 01:24:44.825
...which had been planned
a while ago but till now...

01:24:44.866 --> 01:24:47.835
...had been on hold due to
many points of contention.

01:24:47.869 --> 01:24:50.838
This project will involve
the dropping of ice chunks...

01:24:50.872 --> 01:24:53.841
...floating in high orbit
around Mars onto its equator...

01:24:53.875 --> 01:24:55.706
...in order to form
an artificial ocean.

01:25:12.593 --> 01:25:13.753
C'mon! C'mon!

01:25:13.794 --> 01:25:15.455
Over here!

01:25:15.496 --> 01:25:17.123
Whoa! I'm soaked!

01:25:19.533 --> 01:25:20.625
Hey, what about Mommy?

01:25:20.668 --> 01:25:22.465
- Mommy!
- Yeah, splash her!

01:25:24.071 --> 01:25:25.663
Hey!

01:25:25.706 --> 01:25:27.697
Ooh, now you're
gonna get it!

01:25:27.742 --> 01:25:28.776
Come on!

01:25:28.776 --> 01:25:31.677
Okay... Now I've got you!

01:29:35.389 --> 01:29:37.357
Jesus Christ.

01:29:37.391 --> 01:29:39.416
Between picking you
up from that blast site...

01:29:39.460 --> 01:29:43.294
...and fixing you up this much,
it's been a lot of trouble!

01:29:45.633 --> 01:29:48.932
Are you awake now,
my honey?

01:29:49.537 --> 01:29:52.005
Yes, my master!
